  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing dwellinghouse.<br></p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Location Plan - drawing no. A001 - dated 30/10/2025&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pr. Site Plan - drawing no. A002 - dated 30/10/2025&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Site Photographs - drawing no. A003 - dated 30/10/2025&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Design &amp;amp; Access Statement - drawing no. A004 - dated 30/10/2025&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pr. GF and FF Plan - drawing no. A008 - dated 30/10/2025&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pr. LF and Roof Plan - drawing no. A009 - dated 30/10/2025&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pr. Elevations - drawing no. A010 - dated 30/10/2025&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pr. Building Sections - drawing no. A011 - dated 30/10/2025&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Reasonable Exemption Statement - dated 30th October 2025&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;No other drawings or documents apply.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The two-storey side extension may only be used for purposes incidental to the enjoyment of the dwellinghouse&amp;nbsp;as such. It shall not be used for purposes conflicting with the use of the property as a single dwellinghouse, and in particular it shall not be used as a separate unit of accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
